ngine/godot/issues/123181\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nFixes regression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120125 as it always applied `deletable_properties` on top of the set deletable from `\"metadata/\"`. \r\n\r\nAlso this PR uses `ep_disable_favorite` to always disable favorite for metadatas, I think it was possible that the button would show up in a read only object as was seen in one of the screenshots from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123181, but I didn't check it, so to be certain it's now is disabled. See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101886#issuecomment-2605941522 for why it is disabled. Also the button still didn't work, it ran into the error somewhere further.\r\n\r\nNo AI used.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo",